@invest4introver $MSFT an old 2023 contract to support AI-powered Bing ended, and Microsoft declined to renew. 

Older generation GPUs did not fit this specific customers use case, that doesn't mean they "dunked on Oracle". 

If this happened to new B300 contracts that would be worrysome, but the recent media headlines are extremely misleading.

